      "value": "VRChat client always pull latest asset bundle of latest unity version 1st.\n\nIf you upload with later version than before, you cannot load into it.\n\n(as of design)\n\nOnly option could do be open support ticket at help.vrchat.com and ask for deletation of 2022 build if you want to keep current blueprint ID.\n\nOtherwise, use new blueprint ID could be option.",
